  "2026-08-04T11:47:39.156Z","harness:codex","Evidence: source_kind=external is accepted and canonicalized to global; external blocked_by edges satisfy lifecycle governance without fabricated local items, while the true missing-edge stale finding remains covered. Linked provenance/graph tests and an isolated packed npx graph-audit consumer passed."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T11:47:54.591Z","harness:codex",An external blocker is a real ordering predecessor even without a local item; canonical storage can remain global while accepting external as the clearer authoring alias.
